<text x="0" y="195.58" size="3.81" layer="97">NOTES:

JST footprint pin 1 wrong side per Altium version

Find correct SD card holder footprint

Debug header should be PTH

Add page with plugs and other assembly components

PC2/PC3/PB13/PD9/PE12/PE15 and PD11 unused IO x 7!</text>
