<text x="5.08" y="213.36" size="3.81" layer="97">MCU</text>
<text x="271.78" y="66.04" size="3.81" layer="97">Remember only 16 interrupts 
0 MACRO2 
1 MACRO1 
2 AL_B 
3 KPSTR 
4 JOG_SW/PROBE 
5 X_LIM 
6 A_LIM 
7 DOOR 
8 SPIN/SPEED 
9 YLIM 
10 PRU_RESET/W5500_IRQ 
11 CYC/ST 
12 HALT 
13 Z_LIM 
14 B_LIM 
15 PROBE_DET 
Stallguard pins will use timer capture peripheral.</text>
